Let $x^{\star}$ be as above, $\sigma=\sgn(x^{\star})$,
$\Theta_k=|x^{\star}|^{\T}|G_k|\,|x^{\star}|$, and for $\varepsilon>0$ let
$E$ be the sign-aligned entrywise perturbation $E_{ij}=\varepsilon|G_{ij}|
